      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Desingu et al.",
        "AbstractText": "We report here the first complete genome of the Japanese encephalitis virus (JEV) genotype III strain JEV/SW/IVRI/395A/2014, isolated from stillborn piglets in India. It shares 99% identity with strain JaOArS982 and a few other strains from Japan."
